00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.180
Vincent, I made these myself. Give them a try.

2
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:19.420
Cut the act.

3
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:21.420
Spare me your fake kindness.

4
00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:31.440
Ma'am, Vincent's always been a jerk.

5
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.940
Don't take it to heart.

6
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:37.340
I don't think a housekeeper is in any position to judge her employer.

7
00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:54.140
Don't touch that tree! My mother planted it!

8
00:00:54.140 --> 00:01:43.070
Another little trick to get on my good side?

9
00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.070
What are you doing? Let me go!

10
00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.940
I know exactly what you're after.

11
00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.940
Money.

12
00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.440
Power.

13
00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.940
Status.

14
00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.940
Why not choose me instead?

15
00:01:57.940 --> 00:02:01.940
At the very least, I can give you everything you want.
